From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Vicory <dvicory@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): finalize broker output before completion

Keep a broker-backed task running until capture has fenced its writer and every
selected frozen file is durably installed in native task attachment storage.
Replay exact-run completion intents after failure. Remove writable parent-output
inheritance and import recovery from the generic Kanban contract.
---
